    "detailed_description": "<strong>Shadow Fencer Theatre is the awkward-physics sword fighting game that lets you battle your friends in the ridiculous world of shadow puppets!</strong><br><br>Are you ready to give the best performance of your life? Take center stage and stab your way to the top by battling your scene partner with a unique cast of characters. Whether you are a one-puppet show or sharing the stage, above all else, show the world you are the best performer on the shadowy screen.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914420/extras/43fb20edf716dd123e4de77b82684a6f.poster.avif?t=1588646793\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914420/extras/43fb20edf716dd123e4de77b82684a6f.webm?t=1588646793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914420/extras/43fb20edf716dd123e4de77b82684a6f.mp4?t=1588646793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Co-op Puppet Fights!</h2>Turn your couch into a stage and scuffle it out in multiplayer Improv mode or act solo in a veritable variety show of game modes and skits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sword-flying, Arm-flailing Combat Against Friends and/or Foes!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Story</strong> \u2013 Only you can keep this last-of-its-kind shadow puppet theatre in business.<br></li><li><strong>Marathon</strong> - Survive the gauntlet on your own and become the Grandmaster.<br></li><li><strong>Improv</strong> -Grab a friend or fight solo, selecting the cast, stage and direction of the shadowy fight. Direct the Improv fights with a selection of gameplay variations, limits and more.<br></li><li><strong>Skits</strong> - a proverbial vaudeville with over a dozen mini-games set to delight and distract. Slap, out run, and joust your frenemies.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914420/extras/b73d0133d555f3fe784840844be64eb8.poster.avif?t=1588646793\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914420/extras/b73d0133d555f3fe784840844be64eb8.webm?t=1588646793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914420/extras/b73d0133d555f3fe784840844be64eb8.mp4?t=1588646793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">16+ Handcrafted Characters!</h2>Robots, Giraffes, Pirates and more! An eclectic cast so big we needed a larger dressing room!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">8 Unique Stages!</h2>Behold the power of paper cutouts on sticks and string, and their uncanny ability to set the stage and tell a story. The magic of theatre!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Original Soundtrack!</h2>A collection of musical notes played specifically for this game!<br><br><br><br><br><strong>Acting 101:</strong> Be sure to point the pointy end away from you and towards your opponent.  When all else fails, just do a cheeky sword throw.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Shadow Fencer Theatre is the awkward-physics sword fighting game that lets you battle your friends in the ridiculous world of shadow puppets!</strong><br><br>Are you ready to give the best performance of your life? Take center stage and stab your way to the top by battling your scene partner with a unique cast of characters. Whether you are a one-puppet show or sharing the stage, above all else, show the world you are the best performer on the shadowy screen.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914420/extras/43fb20edf716dd123e4de77b82684a6f.poster.avif?t=1588646793\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914420/extras/43fb20edf716dd123e4de77b82684a6f.webm?t=1588646793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914420/extras/43fb20edf716dd123e4de77b82684a6f.mp4?t=1588646793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Co-op Puppet Fights!</h2>Turn your couch into a stage and scuffle it out in multiplayer Improv mode or act solo in a veritable variety show of game modes and skits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sword-flying, Arm-flailing Combat Against Friends and/or Foes!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Story</strong> \u2013 Only you can keep this last-of-its-kind shadow puppet theatre in business.<br></li><li><strong>Marathon</strong> - Survive the gauntlet on your own and become the Grandmaster.<br></li><li><strong>Improv</strong> -Grab a friend or fight solo, selecting the cast, stage and direction of the shadowy fight. Direct the Improv fights with a selection of gameplay variations, limits and more.<br></li><li><strong>Skits</strong> - a proverbial vaudeville with over a dozen mini-games set to delight and distract. Slap, out run, and joust your frenemies.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914420/extras/b73d0133d555f3fe784840844be64eb8.poster.avif?t=1588646793\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914420/extras/b73d0133d555f3fe784840844be64eb8.webm?t=1588646793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914420/extras/b73d0133d555f3fe784840844be64eb8.mp4?t=1588646793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">16+ Handcrafted Characters!</h2>Robots, Giraffes, Pirates and more! An eclectic cast so big we needed a larger dressing room!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">8 Unique Stages!</h2>Behold the power of paper cutouts on sticks and string, and their uncanny ability to set the stage and tell a story. The magic of theatre!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Original Soundtrack!</h2>A collection of musical notes played specifically for this game!<br><br><br><br><br><strong>Acting 101:</strong> Be sure to point the pointy end away from you and towards your opponent.  When all else fails, just do a cheeky sword throw.",
